{"seq":84,"slug":"frontend-email-development","title":"邮件前端开发实战","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development","rating":{"composite":4.07,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 邮件前端开发实战\n\n邮件前端是一个被严重低估的技术领域。你用 React 写惯了组件化界面，用 Tailwind 排惯了响应式布局，但当你第一次把同样的 CSS 扔进 Outlook，会发现 flexbox 消失了、`<style>` 标签被剥离了、连 `max-width` 都不被认识——这就是邮件开发的现实。本 hub 的存在意义，就是系统地讲清楚这件事：在一个比浏览器落后十年、比 App 生态更碎片化的渲染环境里，如何交付高质量的邮件体验。\n\n四条主线层层递进。第一章「渲染基础」建立认知地图：Outlook 从 Word 引擎迁移到 Edge WebView2 意味着什么？Gmail 为什么要剥离 `<style>` 标签？Apple Mail 的 WebKit 凭什么能原生支持动画？理解了引擎差异，你才知道哪些限制是本质的、哪些是可以渐进增强的。第二章「模板工程」解决效率问题：从手写内联 CSS + 嵌套表格，到 MJML 声明式组件，再到完整的设计系统与组件化模板——这是一条从手工作坊到工业化的演进路径。第三章「交互与动态」突破静态边界：AMP for Email 让邮件能嵌入表单和实时数据，机器学习驱动的个性化让每封邮件在打开瞬间才完成最终组装，可访问性确保这些体验对所有人都可用。第四章「测试与交付」是最后一道防线：你写的模板在 90 多个客户端里长什么样？SPF/DKIM/DMARC 配好了吗？A/B 测试的统计显著性够不够？\n\n本 hub 专注于**前端开发者视角的邮件开发**——模板怎么写、兼容性怎么处理、工具链怎么搭。它不涉及邮件营销策略、文案写作或邮件服务端架构（SMTP 服务器搭建、队列系统等），那些属于别的知识领域。前置要求是扎实的 HTML/CSS 基础，最好有一两年 Web 前端经验；JavaScript 知识在邮件开发中用处有限（99% 的客户端禁用 JS），但理解模板引擎和构建工具会很有帮助。\n\n建议按章节顺序阅读。如果你是邮件开发新手，从第一章开始建立正确的心智模型；如果你已经写过一些邮件但苦于兼容性问题，可以直接跳到第二章的 MJML 部分；如果你的团队要把邮件开发工程化，第二章和第四章是重点。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"email-rendering-foundations","title":"邮件渲染基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-rendering-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"client-rendering-engines","title":"邮件客户端渲染引擎差异","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-rendering-foundations/client-rendering-engines"},{"seq":2,"slug":"html-email-compatibility","title":"HTML邮件兼容策略","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-rendering-foundations/html-email-compatibility"},{"seq":3,"slug":"inline-css-table-layout","title":"内联CSS与表格布局","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-rendering-foundations/inline-css-table-layout"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"email-template-engineering","title":"邮件模板工程","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-template-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"responsive-email-design","title":"响应式邮件设计","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-template-engineering/responsive-email-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mjml-frameworks","title":"MJML与邮件框架","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-template-engineering/mjml-frameworks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"template-componentization","title":"邮件模板组件化","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-template-engineering/template-componentization"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"email-interaction-dynamic","title":"邮件交互与动态","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-interaction-dynamic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"amp-for-email","title":"AMP for Email 交互式邮件","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-interaction-dynamic/amp-for-email"},{"seq":2,"slug":"personalization-dynamic-content","title":"邮件个性化与动态内容","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-interaction-dynamic/personalization-dynamic-content"},{"seq":3,"slug":"email-accessibility","title":"邮件可访问性","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-interaction-dynamic/email-accessibility"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"email-testing-delivery","title":"邮件测试与交付","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-testing-delivery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"testing-tools-workflow","title":"邮件测试工具与流程","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-testing-delivery/testing-tools-workflow"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deliverability-authentication","title":"邮件送达率与认证","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-testing-delivery/deliverability-authentication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"analytics-ab-testing","title":"邮件数据分析与 A/B 测试","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-email-development/email-testing-delivery/analytics-ab-testing"}]}]}